4352033424685834335_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rM-aa_E7RXkQ7kNvwH3l0Ti&_nc_oc=Adq4RT75O65_BXb0rxWWqtEpYkac6h_NI9-tN8Hlnz11MCGhXxdPTb7V92QBw1mxNlc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEeerIaUg9DV5HPk7Wdt2Qp_r-r-x8htbaX9t5AulzVcw&oe=6A940956"}, "display_name": "Monsters and Mazes Backrooms", "keywords": ["Monsters", "Mazes", "Monster", "Maze", "Horror"], "long_description": "**Run** from the Monster...\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udca8 \n**Escape** the Maze... \ud83e\udd14\n**Become** the Monster... \ud83d\udc7b\n\nMonsters and Mazes is a **Multiplayer PvP Horror** game where one player is the monster and the rest need to Solve and Escape from a Maze before the Monster can get them...\n\n# \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Current Mazes & Monsters :\n- Dino Jungle + T-Rex \ud83e\udd96\n{1466563128145823}\n- Falcons High + Necro Gorgon \ud83c\udfeb\n{1406394327856553}\n- Fun Center + Gorilla Gang \ud83c\udf82\n{660554287120395}\n- Smiler + Backrooms \ud83d\udeaa\n{674874741845817}\n- Scarecrow + Corn Maze \ud83c\udf3d\n{1096838768878140}\n- Minotaur + Labyrinth \ud83d\udc02\n{786089887612482}\n- Stalker + Dark Forest\n- Vents + Banshee \n\n# Play Monsters and Mazes Today! \n{2537963193236292}\n\n", "short_description": "Find the Lost Footage... Escape the Backrooms... or Become the Entities"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mystical-mote-389916.web.app/monstersandmazes/policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Red Team Interactive Inc", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/dCKnWdMsu3", "website_url": "https://mystical-mote-389916.web.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_RE